<title>HONG KONG: Paul Y-ITC interim net up one percent.</title>
<headline>Paul Y-ITC interim net up one percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   12.8     vs 14.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    4.0	vs 4.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    133.31   vs 132.05</p>
<p>    Turnover		     3,044.88 vs 2,815.19</p>
<p>    Company name		 Paul Y. - ITC Construction</p>
<p>				     Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 20-24, 1997</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   March 15, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - Paul Y-ITC is a civil engineering and construction company. The company gave no details on the basis for calculation of basic share earnings.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
